WEBVTT

00:05:57.396 --> 00:06:01.316
Secondly, also by providing
clean alternatives,

00:06:01.316 --> 00:06:02.996
and more importantly,

00:06:03.036 --> 00:06:05.236
by involving the local communities --

00:06:05.276 --> 00:06:07.796
because they’re the first to be impacted,

00:06:07.836 --> 00:06:10.916
and they must also have a seat
in the conversation.

00:06:11.796 --> 00:06:13.476
In the last decade,

00:06:13.516 --> 00:06:17.356
technology has moved at a fast pace.

00:06:17.956 --> 00:06:21.076
It has lowered its costs dramatically.

00:06:21.716 --> 00:06:25.876
Africa can, and must, develop

00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:28.476
with all the energy it requires

00:06:28.516 --> 00:06:32.836
without incurring
the disastrous impact of coal,